    "title": "Chicken Katsu with Curry Sauce",
    "text": "Serves 4.\n\nFOR THE CHICKEN\n2 chicken breasts, butterflied\n100 g panko breadcrumbs\n2 eggs, beaten\n50 g plain flour\n\nFOR THE CURRY SAUCE\n1 tablespoon vegetable oil\n1 onion, sliced\n2 tablespoons medium curry powder\n500 ml chicken stock\n\nYOU WILL ALSO NEED\nA deep frying pan\nA meat thermometer\nKitchen paper for draining\n\nCoat the chicken in flour, then egg, then panko. Fry until golden. Make the sauce while it rests.",
